n        ))\n        ->run();\n\nThread safety: closures passed to behavior() and configure() MUST be static\nand capture only serializable values. Class-string actors (actor(), stateful())\nare always thread-safe \u2014 only strings cross thread boundaries.\";}}s:4:\"type\";E:60:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeType:TYPE_CLASS\";s:69:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\u0000classLikeName\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:43:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\WorkerPool\\Swoole\\WorkerPool\";}s:8:\"inherits\";a:0:{}s:12:\"dependencies\";a:34:{i:0;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:23:\"Psr\\Log\\LoggerInterface\";}s:7:\"context\";O:53:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyContext\":2:{s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:57:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-worker-pool-swoole\/src\/WorkerPool.php\";s:4:\"line\";i:43;}s:14:\"dependencyType\";E:59:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyType:VARIABLE\";}}i:1;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:7:\"Closure\";}s:7:\"context\";O:53:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyContext\":2:{s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:57:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-worker-pool-swoole\/src\/WorkerPool.php\";s:4:\"line\";i:46;}s:14:\"dependencyType\";r:19;}}i:2;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\