t Runnable defines $running and $id; we inherit its constructor\nunchanged and do all real work inside run().\n\nIMPORTANT: Do NOT wrap the body in Swoole\\Coroutine\\run() \u2014 $system->run()\nstarts the Swoole event loop itself, and nesting another run() inside a\ncoroutine raises \"Unable to call Event::wait() in coroutine\".\";}s:15:\"@psalm-suppress\";a:1:{i:0;s:75:\"UnusedClass, UndefinedClass, MissingDependency, PropertyNotSetInConstructor\";}}s:4:\"type\";E:60:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeType:TYPE_CLASS\";s:69:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeReference\u0000classLikeName\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:47:\"Monadial\\Nexus\\WorkerPool\\Swoole\\WorkerRunnable\";}s:8:\"inherits\";a:1:{i:0;O:46:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\AstInherit\":4:{s:13:\"classLikeName\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:22:\"Swoole\\Thread\\Runnable\";}s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurrence\":2:{s:8:\"filepath\";s:61:\"\/app\/packages\/nexus-worker-pool-swoole\/src\/WorkerRunnable.php\";s:4:\"line\";i:52;}s:4:\"type\";E:58:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\AstInheritType:EXTENDS\";s:52:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\AstInherit\u0000path\";a:0:{}}}s:12:\"dependencies\";a:14:{i:0;O:51:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyToken\":2:{s:5:\"token\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\":1:{s:61:\"\u0000Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\ClassLikeToken\u0000className\";s:17:\"Swoole\\Thread\\Map\";}s:7:\"context\";O:53:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\DependencyContext\":2:{s:14:\"fileOccurrence\";O:50:\"Deptrac\\Deptrac\\Contract\\Ast\\AstMap\\FileOccurr